            "created_at": "2025-09-10T00:30:26.978243+00:00",
            "notes": "# Power & Items\n\n**[Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212)**:\n- Adds +1 additional torpedo charge\n- Your bread and butter in this Season, unless you want to play healbot with [MediMaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6), refer to a different guide.\n\n**[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)**:\n- Increases both damage AND healing through primary fire\n- Essential for sustaining tank while poking\n\n**[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)**:\n- Boosts torpedo damage significantly\n- Critical with Pulsar for enhanced impact\n\n**[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)**: \n- 25 armor for survivability during aggressive positioning\n- Ashe is almost picked every game, this will keep you somewhat alive\n\n---\n\n## Round 1 Playstyle\n\n**Avoid Dying**: \n- Can't farm when you are dead\n- Position as far back as possible without losing the ability to heal and torpedo\n- Even if your whole team dies, escape with Hyper Ring if it's up\n\n**Farm Aggressively**: \n- Pocket your tank and take **aggressive angles for torpedoes when the enemy team is distracted**\n- Use the tank as your anchor point while staying far back\n- Use torpedoes to heal critically low allies\n\n**Positioning Strategy**:\n- **Narrow spaces**: Torpedo your allies when critically low\n- **Wide spaces**: Take risky positions for good torpedo shots on allied and enemy teams for credits\n\n**Priority**: Stay Alive > Heal Tank > Kill and Assist > Torpedo Damage",
