            "notes": "# Items\n\n**[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)**:\n- Huge Ability Power boost\n- Prioritize this over other items without selling\n\n**[Lux Loop](item_afa69bd2-683f-486d-bc1e-e40d49281679)**:\n- Great for teammates who don't know how to touch your hyper ring (low elo)\n- Makes hyper ring last longer (indirect cooldown reduction)\n- Gets more value with powers and additional AP\n\n**[Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7)** (optional): \n- Gives you cheap sustain\n\n**[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)** (optional): \n- Shoot faster = faster healing + faster damage\n\n---\n\n## Round 2 Playstyle\n\nSame as Round 1",
