            "notes": "# Power & Items\n\n**[Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca)**:\n- Still strong after the nerfs\n- Counters Cybervenom and anti heal\n\n\n**[PulStar Destroyers](item_707ad8c7-a153-4140-b4bc-1f23f7d7a648)**:\n- Gives you a lot value for little credits, you can pressure the enemy team and execute to stay afloat economy wise.\n\n**[Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214)**:\n- Insane value\n- Replace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with this\n \nSell the green items if you can get all of the listen ones.\n---\n\n## Round 3 Playstyle\n\nYou are no longer a healbot, you can take even more aggressive angles to get massive torpedoes, tossing a hyper ring will affect clashes greatly, less healing, more dealing, use it for mobility or overheal",
